[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2631669098","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102073#issuecomment-2631669098","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102073","id":2631669098,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6c3BVq","user":{"login":"yogi-tud","id":6371841,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNzE4NDE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6371841?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogi-tud","html_url":"https://github.com/yogi-tud","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogi-tud/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogi-tud/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogi-tud/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogi-tud/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogi-tud/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogi-tud/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogi-tud/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogi-tud/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yogi-tud/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-03T17:47:11Z","updated_at":"2025-02-03T17:47:11Z","body":"I can confirm this exists on v4.3.stable.mono.official [77dcf97d8] as well.\nScene A has packedscene B as exported variable \nScene B has packedscene A as exported variable\n\nBoth scenes show as correctly set up in editor.\nAt runtime one packedScene will become null.\n\nI tried to remove the last few hardcoded file paths for loading scenes in my project and replace them with [export] packedscenes.\n\nMRP for 4.3 stable:\n\nThe project will not correctly open a 2nd time and asks to fix dependencies.\nNo broken dependencies will show.\n\nSteps to reproduce:\n1. create 3 scenes (main, a, b)\n2. A has packedscene B as [export] variable set\n3. B has packedscene A as [export] variable set\n4. Add A and B to main\n5. set main scene\n6. compile and launch.\n\n[mrp_cyclic_bug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18646136/mrp_cyclic_bug.zip)\n\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2631669098/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2649841557","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102073#issuecomment-2649841557","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102073","id":2649841557,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6d8V-V","user":{"login":"zurasuta","id":25066388,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MDY2Mzg4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25066388?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zurasuta","html_url":"https://github.com/zurasuta","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zurasuta/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zurasuta/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zurasuta/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zurasuta/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zurasuta/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zurasuta/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zurasuta/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zurasuta/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zurasuta/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-11T05:39:07Z","updated_at":"2025-02-11T05:39:07Z","body":"Is this a bug? Cause I tried it in the past too and had the same issue, but I thought cyclical dependecies were just not supported.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2649841557/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2651343731","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102073#issuecomment-2651343731","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102073","id":2651343731,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6eCEtz","user":{"login":"MrBlockers","id":1747505,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDc1MDU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1747505?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrBlockers","html_url":"https://github.com/MrBlockers","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrBlockers/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrBlockers/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrBlockers/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrBlockers/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrBlockers/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrBlockers/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrBlockers/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrBlockers/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrBlockers/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-11T16:29:51Z","updated_at":"2025-02-11T16:29:51Z","body":"My understanding is they aren't supported currently also but an effort seems to be being made to solve them based on the tracker. So I wanted to provide another MRP for debugging purposes.\n\nIn this case it surprised me in my actual project and the cause of the error was not obvious until I spent time stripping stuff out. The fact that rearranging the preloads without removing the cyclic dependency fixes the issue also seems to me like a bug.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2651343731/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2676064650","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102073#issuecomment-2676064650","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102073","id":2676064650,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6fgYGK","user":{"login":"elTigre9","id":33560876,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNTYwODc2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33560876?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/elTigre9","html_url":"https://github.com/elTigre9","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elTigre9/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elTigre9/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elTigre9/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elTigre9/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elTigre9/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elTigre9/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elTigre9/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elTigre9/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elTigre9/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-22T07:10:16Z","updated_at":"2025-02-22T07:10:16Z","body":"I found that removing the `preload` and replacing with `load` helps, **BUT** in order to be able to open your \"corrupted\" scenes, you can comment out the PackedScene code for the new scene you want to transition to (in the .tscn file), then run the project, where you'll get errors. Those seem to clean things up and I'm able to open my scenes again and run the game like normal.\n\nNote: I had my scene transition code in a Control node so that I could black out the screen slowly before triggering the transition. Because I commented out the code and then ran it, it deleted the commented out the \"Transitioner\" node, effectively removing it from the scene. I had to manually re-add each \"Transitioner\".\n\nFinally, I removed the cyclical scene. I've been using `load` and it still gave me the problem. I guess I'll have to figure out another way...maybe just reload the entire game once the end credits are done?\n\nHope that works for others!","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2676064650/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2842914354","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102073#issuecomment-2842914354","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102073","id":2842914354,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6pc24y","user":{"login":"MarianoGnu","id":1776044,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NzYwNDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1776044?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu","html_url":"https://github.com/MarianoGnu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-30T18:25:04Z","updated_at":"2025-04-30T18:25:04Z","body":"I stumbled into this issue today in Godot 4.4.1-custom build","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2842914354/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3577441288","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102073#issuecomment-3577441288","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102073","id":3577441288,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7VO2wI","user":{"login":"Nallebeorn","id":7013489,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwMTM0ODk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7013489?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn","html_url":"https://github.com/Nallebeorn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-25T20:21:45Z","updated_at":"2025-11-25T20:21:45Z","body":"Still reproducible in 4.5.1 and 4.6-dev4.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.githu